# Website link icons

- Use recognizable GitHub and LinkedIn brand icons beside their text labels, following TokenTracking's social-link treatment.
- Use consistent SVG icons for other link actions, such as donation hearts and download arrows, rather than substituting generic Unicode symbols for brand marks.
- Serve icons locally. Keep decorative icons hidden from assistive technology with an empty alt or aria-hidden; preserve readable link labels and keyboard focus styles.
- Keep the same icon treatment in navigation, support sections, and the footer, including responsive layouts.
